nt creation rejection for cancelled orders\n\nTests         newly created order has ACTIVE status - Verifies status initialization\n              cancels an active order and returns 200 - Core cancel functionality\n              cancel an active order with created shipments cancels those shipments - Cascade logic\n              cancelling an already cancelled order succeeds idempotently - Idempotency requirement\n              cancel with confirmed shipment returns 409 and changes nothing - Conflict atomicity\n              cancel nonexistent order returns 404 - Error handling\n              get order reports cancelled status - Status persistence\n              create shipment for cancelled order returns 409 - Prevention of shipments on cancelled orders\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test (from sample-service/)\n              Result: BUILD SUCCESS - 21 tests passed (11 OrderControllerTest, 6 ShipmentControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests, 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n\nNot done      None - all acceptance criteria satisfied\n```","ttft_ms":2931,"type":"result","duration_ms":170878,"uuid":"e9013b4c-e496-4ee8-97b4-673cbac91781","ttft_stream_ms":615,"time_to_request_ms":34,"first_content_frame_ms":615,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

